          <groundspeak:finder id="25790230">MaybeSunshine</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP251 Nanton [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bridgeland at the beginning of the day and Nanton at the end…I guess I roamed a tad today. This was an easy find in a hole full of leaves. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="681445385">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-24T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1298988">dronnord</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP251 Nanton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N 50° 21.157 W 113° 45.611&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevation: 1090.0 metres..this one is also out to lunch. My GPSr had a malfunction and I scrambled to put everything back in place but I obviously missed correcting the altimeter or set something wrong. Dang it all. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the BCP OFTH !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2nd of the day&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="681184507">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-24T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP251 - Nanton

&lt;strong&gt;Posted:&lt;/strong&gt;  N50° 21.157' W113° 45.608'

&lt;strong&gt;My GPSr:&lt;/strong&gt;  N50° 21.155' W113° 45.611'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We made a quick stop and grab of this one along the quiet lane just outside of town. The air was full of mist and the birds were chirping like crazy: a nice way to start a day of capping&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
