          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP251 Nanton

I made a small detour while driving to Calgary to look for this brass cap. It was an easy find, took a few photos, and was soon on my way north. Thanks OFTH for another nice cap.&lt;/p&gt;

